        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "5705005c-3c88-5900-a9ae-df4de7ba525d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Pinocchio (1940 film), Home on the Range (2004 film), Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs (1937)\n- Song: \"I've Got No Strings\"\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions, Walt Disney Feature Animation, Walt Disney Pictures\n- People: Carlo Collodi, Dickie Jones\n- Topics: Disney animated feature films, film source material\n\nFacts:\n- Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs was released in 1937 and its success preceded Disney's production of Pinocchio.\n- Pinocchio is a 1940 American animated musical fantasy film produced by Walt Disney Productions.\n- Pinocchio was based on the Italian children's novel The Adventures of Pinocchio by Carlo Collodi.\n- Pinocchio was the second animated feature film produced by Disney.\n- \"I've Got No Strings,\" also known as \"I Got No Strings,\" is a song from Disney's animated film Pinocchio.\n- Dickie Jones sang \"I've Got No Strings\" as Pinocchio.\n- Home on the Range is a 2004 American animated musical western comedy film produced by Walt Disney Feature Animation.\n- Home on the Range was released by Walt Disney Pictures.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "9d534ca4-7ae8-5cb3-82d2-4286b4756a64",
        "text": "Page: Pinocchio (1940 film). Sentence: Pinocchio is a 1940 American animated musical fantasy film produced by Walt Disney Productions and based on the Italian children's novel \"The Adventures of Pinocchio\" by Carlo Collodi.\nPage: Pinocchio (1940 film). Sentence: It was the second animated feature film produced by Disney, made after the success of \"Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs\" (1937).\nPage: Home on the Range (2004 film). Sentence: Home on the Range is a 2004 American animated musical western comedy film produced by Walt Disney Feature Animation and released by Walt Disney Pictures.\nPage: I've Got No Strings. Sentence: \"I've Got No Strings\" also known as \"I Got No Strings\" is a song from Walt Disney's animated film \"Pinocchio\" sung by Dickie Jones as Pinocchio.",
